        "startIndex": 7398,
        "endIndex": 7634,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Public API limits (such as a 150k token-per-minute cap) and lack of prompt caching discounts make the public tier restrictive for heavy autonomous coding loops without upgrading to dedicated enterprise instances"
      },
